---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Academy"
  description="An academy enquiry for Lavya: hair, skin, makeup and spa training in Bhubaneswar."
>
  <header class="editorial-hero">
    <svg class="editorial-hero__strand" viewBox="0 0 600 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        data-strand
        d="M 470 -40 C 340 120 520 240 400 360 C 300 460 140 420 150 540 C 158 640 300 650 430 600"
      ></path>
    </svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Academy</p>
      <h1 class="editorial-hero__title display" data-split="lines">Learn the craft, properly.</h1>
      <p class="editorial-hero__lede" data-reveal="up">
        A small training enquiry for people who want to work in a salon, not just pass a course.
        Hair, skin, makeup and spa, taught on the floor.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="editorial-body">
    <div class="wrap editorial-grid">
      <div class="editorial-grid__main prose">
        <p>
          Most salon training stops at a certificate. The part that matters is what happens
          after: reading a client, choosing the right service, adjusting halfway through, and
          finishing work you would put your own name on.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are shaping a small academy programme around that gap. The details are still being
          written, so we are listening first. If you want to train with a working salon team,
          tell us where you are starting from.
        </p>

        <h2>Areas we would cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Cutting and finishing, from the consultation to the last section.</li>
          <li>Colour, highlights and the chemistry behind a safe result.</li>
          <li>Skin analysis, facials, clean-ups and aftercare.</li>
          <li>Bridal and occasion makeup in HD and airbrush finishes.</li>
          <li>Spa routines, pressure, draping and a quiet room.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How it would work</h2>
        <p>
          Small groups, supervised practice and time on the floor with real appointments. We
          would rather teach fewer people well than fill a room. The schedule, duration and fee
          will be confirmed in writing before anything begins.
        </p>

        <div class="editorial-image" data-reveal="scale">
          <img
            src="/images/makeup.webp"
            width="220"
            height="220"
            alt="A makeup artist applying eye makeup with a brush."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="editorial-grid__side">
        <div class="enquiry">
          <h2>Register interest</h2>
          <p>
            Tell us what you already know, what you want to learn, and how many days a week you
            can commit. We will reply when the next group is being planned.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--solid" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Academy%20enquiry`}>
            Email the team
            <svg class="btn__arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 10 10 2M4 2h6v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
            Or call <a class="inline-link" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
